# Vulnerability exceptions for the CI CRITICAL gate (lab 41).
#
# Rules of the road:
#   - one CVE per line, ALWAYS with a comment saying why it's acceptable and when
#     it expires / will be revisited
#   - a naked entry with no justification should not survive code review
#   - prefer fixing (bump the dependency / base image) over ignoring
#
# Example (remove when adding real entries):
# CVE-2026-12345  # false positive in indirect dep X; upstream fix pending, revisit 2026-08-01
